# `unknown-name`: a template call is a call like any (Templates ch. 2). `Broken`'s
# `<@Nope ...>` names nothing; `Fine`'s `<@Quote ...>` calls `Quote`, and checks clean.
Quote: fn Text -> Text
fn Quote text = "> {text}"

Broken: fn Nat -> Text
fn Broken n = inline_text <txt>
<@Nope x=<<n>>/>
</txt>

Fine: fn Text -> Text
fn Fine t = inline_text <txt>
<@Quote text=<<t>>/>
</txt>
